Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: querencia-webhuelle
Comment: Generated from copyright.in by werkzeuge/copyright-erzeugen.py.
 The cargo-vendor/ stanzas come from the vendored crates' Cargo.toml.
 The source is the repository querencia-nachrichten (tag webhuelle/0.2.0) in
 querencia-webhuelle/ and the workspace querencia-runtime as a second
 upstream archive in querencia-runtime/; this package builds only the
 program with the crates querencia-oberflaeche and querencia-dateiarbeit.
 The program links dynamically against WebKitGTK 6.0 and JavaScriptCore
 (libwebkitgtk-6.0-4, LGPL-2.1+ and BSD-2-Clause), GTK 4, GLib and libsoup
 (LGPL); the Rust bindings gtk-rs and webkit6-rs are MIT (cargo-vendor/).
 WhatsApp is a trademark of its owner; this program is not a product of
 WhatsApp or Meta and is not affiliated with them. It contains no logo of
 WhatsApp. The names and the logo of Querencia are marks of the project
 (MARKE.md), not covered by the licences below.

